Astra Shader v1 — License (interim)

Interim status: PERSONAL USE ONLY (per .specs/astra-shader/design.md §9).
This pack borrows code from third-party shaderpacks under licenses that do not
yet permit redistribution; see THIRD-PARTY.md for the per-module ledger.

Before any public release, the publication gate (design.md §9.3) must be run:
rewrite/replace GPL or all-rights-reserved derived modules, then re-decide the
final license here.
